{"unit_id":"yaoshuo530__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-1","repo":"yaoshuo530/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"0def91744bdf841a4a5ae2dd3f8a01104b4f390c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「提示词澄清」：分析草稿是否缺少会显著影响结果的信息，并可生成最多三个澄清问题和默认假设。点击输入框工具栏的“增强”后触发；问题显示在界面卡片中供用户回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:126-145","lib/index.js:221-243","lib/client.js:96-140"]}
{"unit_id":"yaoshuo530__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-2","repo":"yaoshuo530/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"0def91744bdf841a4a5ae2dd3f8a01104b4f390c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「结合上下文生成」：使用当前会话的人设、记忆及最近最多 30 条对话，并将草稿、回答和假设交给会话模型生成增强后的提示词。用户提交草稿或澄清答案后触发，结果以文本返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:58-88","lib/index.js:246-288"]}
{"unit_id":"yaoshuo530__dsh-prompt-enhancer#feature-3","repo":"yaoshuo530/dsh-prompt-enhancer","commit":"0def91744bdf841a4a5ae2dd3f8a01104b4f390c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-enhancer 的功能「预览并应用」：将生成的提示词显示在覆盖卡片中，用户可选择放弃或应用到当前输入框草稿。生成完成后自动显示预览，点击“应用到输入框”才写入草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:142-163","lib/client.js:190-199"]}
